          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwumbala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kwenu kwana mate naga mkukuya yigakuti Malamusi. Nambo naga ngimkugakuya Malamusigo, bola mkagambe kutama ngawumbala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga mundu jwangawumbala akukuya yigakuti Malamusigo, ana jwalakweju ngasaŵa mpela mundu jwamwumbale pameso pa Mlungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa ŵele ŵali ŵangawumbala cipagwileco nambo akugasunga Malamusi ni kuti tacimgomeka m'mwejo ŵamli ŵawumbale, pakuti mkwete Malamusi gakulembedwa nambo ngamkutendaga yigakuti Malamusigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuŵa Myuda jwamwumbale ni kutendaga yigakuti Malamusi yeleyi ngayikumtendesya m'mwejo kuŵa Myuda msyesyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myuda msyesyene ni jwali Myuda mu mtima mwakwe, soni kuwumbala kusyesyene kukusaŵaga kwa mu mtima, kwele kukusatendekwaga ni Msimu Ŵaswela, ngaŵaga ni Malamusi gakulembedwa. Mundu jwamti myoyo akusapocela matogolelo kutyocela kwa Mlungu, ngaŵaga kwa ŵandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
